{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a symbolic support DLC that does not affect your gameplay and is not required to enjoy the game. It exists for players who wish to show their support through action, enabling us to focus on new content and creative development. It\u2019s not our livelihood, but it\u2019s what helps the team go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a token of appreciation, we\u2019ve transformed a simple compass into a <strong>Golden Compass</strong>\u2014shiny, unique, and representing your support on this journey. It won\u2019t make your journey faster, but it will make it more stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you buy it or not, it won\u2019t change your enjoyment of the game. Knowing that you\u2019re playing our creation is already our greatest support. \u2764\ufe0f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3945540?t=1761033970","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945540/fe293ca4114e6ea00d25e5bb853fab139d66ef47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761033970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945540/46d0aa37ba8f05bc93a5062165f89f6a663b75a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761033970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945540/46d0aa37ba8f05bc93a5062165f89f6a663b75a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761033970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains